Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.23,0:00:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.65,0:00:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.45,0:00:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.47,0:01:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice win, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.85,0:01:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it to round two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.13,0:01:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And I owe Duke a stake. Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.95,0:01:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,The next two bouts will now begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.57,0:01:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, guys, or we're\Ngonna miss the next duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.77,0:01:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,In lock B, we have regional champ\Nand self-proclaimed child genius,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.61,0:01:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca Hopkins!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.53,0:01:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.51,0:01:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll face the\Nmodel-turned-actress-turned-kong-fu-master-turned-duelist,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.75,0:01:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Vivian Wong!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.83,0:01:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Not her!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.87,0:01:37.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, that diva\Nis nothing but bad news!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.49,0:01:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.40,0:01:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's another duel I\Ncan't get enough! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.79,0:01:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess someone's excited to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you like dueling, but if you don't\Ncalm down, you're gonna hurt yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.33,0:01:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been so long since\NI've been near the action.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I just gotta...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.47,0:01:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.51,0:01:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Told ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.87,0:01:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.43,0:02:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it appears he's thrown his back out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.29,0:02:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.47,0:02:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll radio for a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.11,0:02:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just relax, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.25,0:02:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.39,0:02:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You just go with your friends and\Nenjoy the rest of the tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can't leave you like this. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.71,0:02:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall look after your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.09,0:02:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You go and root for Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.09,0:02:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you sure, Professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.35,0:02:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My granddaughter would never admit it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but she could really use\Nsome support out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.43,0:02:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the last time I eat\Nbean burritos before a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.03,0:02:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's are kicking in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is gonna work?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.69,0:02:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being so negative, Rex!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:46.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Name the last time one\Nof my ideas did work!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.93,0:02:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time, just once, I'd like to get\Nmy revenge without looking like a doofus!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.55,0:02:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oy, stadium food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.31,0:03:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.19,0:03:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So much for not looking like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.77,0:03:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and keep your balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.79,0:03:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have to go to the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.71,0:03:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's gonna be really\Nshort and really lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.55,0:03:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Kinda like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.27,0:03:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping for a real opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.61,0:03:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Not someone who needs mommy's permission\Nto duel someone strong like Yugi. He's so
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.09,0:03:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,commanding yet sweet and gentle all at the\Nsame time look viv you won't be stepping
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.11,0:03:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,within 50 feet of my yugi so give it up\Noh is that so trust me when i ace this
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.47,0:03:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,tournament and become\Na celebrity yugi will
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.63,0:03:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,forget all about you i bet he already has
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.21,0:03:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, you're gonna tell\Nteacher I'm picking on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.25,0:04:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go, Half-Pint. Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.71,0:04:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go first. You'll need a head start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.33,0:04:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I summon Kung Fu Nian Nian in attack mode
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.51,0:04:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Top that, shrimp No problem, look out\NTime to activate a little magic card
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.07,0:04:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Graceful Charity Now I\Nget to draw three new
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.37,0:04:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,cards As long as I\Ndiscard two from my hand
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.95,0:04:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I think I'll summon my\NFire Princess in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.53,0:04:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll place two cards\Nface down. That'll do for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.95,0:04:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out, guys, I found\Nit! Yo, Beck, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.73,0:05:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.35,0:05:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, Yugi-poo. I knew you'd be here\Nto cheer me on, my little dumpling.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's here for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.25,0:05:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Pumpkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I trounce this little\Ntwerp, it's all about you and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.71,0:05:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.87,0:05:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my hero, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's your secret?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.09,0:05:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, natural charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.67,0:05:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is why I need\Nmore female friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.17,0:05:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy, Rebecca!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That glamazon has gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.33,0:05:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you ready to dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.51,0:05:34.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, I don't dance with preschoolers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.35,0:05:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where was I? Oh, yeah. I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to kick your puny butt back\Nto the playpen with my Kung Fu Nian.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.29,0:05:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Who, by the way, gets 300 extra\Npoints thanks to her special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.23,0:05:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I summon my Master\NKianshi in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, it's time to\Nextinguish your Fire Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.29,0:06:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In your dreams, Fiv,\NI reveal my trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little something I\Nlike to call gravity bind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.35,0:06:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as it's on the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't attack me with any monster\Nthat has more than three stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.25,0:06:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.75,0:06:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That little brat's gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.67,0:06:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No one makes a fool out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel's far from done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, so far, so good. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But Rebecca's trap card\Naffects her own monsters, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.09,0:06:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If they have more than three\Nstars, she can't use them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.57,0:06:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.79,0:06:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that this is\Nall part of her plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.83,0:06:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a load of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.27,0:06:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,First,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm activating Marie the Fallen One's\Nspecial ability from the card graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I automatically receive\N200 extra life points
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.51,0:07:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,for every turn that Marie\Nremains in the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.15,0:07:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And to finish things off, I'll activate\Nthe special ability of my Fire Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So every time my life points\Nincrease, yours increase by 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.81,0:07:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it. Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.15,0:07:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca's three-card combo allows her to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.33,0:07:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,automatically lower Vivian's\Nlife points every turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card face\Ndown, and that'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.69,0:07:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Viv, tell me how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, to lose to a preschooler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.13,0:07:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything seems to be running smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.61,0:07:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's what worries me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.73,0:07:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have expected my little\Nhacker friend to strike again by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.65,0:07:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless he's already in Kaivaland.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.29,0:07:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Roland, run a background\Ncheck of every competitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.29,0:07:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that understood? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.73,0:08:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, everyone is a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.51,0:08:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm through going easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.05,0:08:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's go time now, so wipe\Nthat smile off your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Or else I will. Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.91,0:08:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,There appears to be some\Nnasty weather up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not scared of a\Nlittle rain, are you, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.83,0:08:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I activate the magic\Ncard, Mystical Space Typhoon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.07,0:08:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tough break.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.07,0:08:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now your trap goes bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.01,0:08:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, Gravity Bind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.39,0:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.65,0:08:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Vivian can attack with\Nall her powerful monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Face Down card!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Order!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as this trap remains on my side of\Nthe field, your magic cards are useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That brat did it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play the magic card, Scapegoat!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.55,0:09:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, I guess your storm blew over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.55,0:09:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.61,0:09:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't Scapegoat disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.73,0:09:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because she drew Scapegoat\Nfirst but played it last and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's simple, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.31,0:09:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The last card played in a\Nturn always activates first,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.89,0:09:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,so the first card has no effect on the\Nlast even though it was played first.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.49,0:09:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so last is first? Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.35,0:09:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And since Rebecca used scapegoat last,\Nit was unaffected by Imperial Order!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, man. It's simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.23,0:09:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then perhaps you'd like\Nto explain it to me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.41,0:09:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, twerp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Playtime's over, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.49,0:09:38.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you may have stopped me\Nfrom playing any of my magic
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.71,0:09:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,cards or any monster that\Nhas more than three stars,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.65,0:09:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but watch this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.09,0:09:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't stop me from\Nplaying Gaku-ji-rei Panda!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And now to activate his special power.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.23,0:10:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,For every monster you have on the field,\Nmy cuddly panda gains 500 extra points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.51,0:10:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, now it's got over\N3,000 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have any hidden\Ntrap cards to stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.01,0:10:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my Pegasus, attack her\Nscapegoat with Kung Pao Paw!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.11,0:10:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And since my panda's attack points are\Ngreater than your scapegoat's defense points,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.15,0:10:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,the difference comes\Nout of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,One more attack, and you're bear bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.99,0:10:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Beck?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.71,0:10:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You got the sniffles because\Nmy panda scratched out
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,most of your life points\Nwith one swipe of his paw?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.29,0:10:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, how sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.15,0:10:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, you think I care? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.81,0:10:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.72,0:10:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like you can do\Nanything. Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I'll free up my magic cards. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens next, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I collect my 200 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.15,0:11:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.33,0:11:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget about the 500 points\Nyou lose thanks to my fire princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.97,0:11:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really starting to\Nbug me, you little runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.59,0:11:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.27,0:11:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't like that, well, then you're\Ngonna hate this, Token Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.03,0:11:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, it destroys my three\Nremaining scapegoats,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.77,0:11:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,but it gives me an extra\N800 points for each one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.55,0:11:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and since I just got stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.55,0:11:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,my fire princess takes a\Nfew more points from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.59,0:11:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.99,0:11:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got one more little\Nsurprise for you, Viv.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.01,0:11:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Injection Fairy Lily!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.61,0:11:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I sacrifice 2,000 of my life\Npoints to make Lily stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.39,0:12:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack her overstuffed teddy bear!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.61,0:12:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.97,0:12:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The Beck is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.39,0:12:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So the first card's last.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.35,0:12:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the last card goes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.29,0:12:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I end my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.85,0:12:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll start off with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.51,0:12:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a handy little magic\Ncard called Luminous Clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This gives me the power to\Nsacrifice my Kung Fu Nian Nian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.95,0:12:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,along with my Master Kian Shi\Nin order to summon Dragon Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.91,0:12:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She can't attack with that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.25,0:12:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dragon Lady's a seven-star monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.05,0:12:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's strange. I know. What's she up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.31,0:12:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad news, Junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.99,0:12:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Every turn that my Dragon\NLady doesn't attack,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.89,0:12:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,she automatically destroys one\Nof your magic or trap cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate my\NMystic Eruption card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.75,0:13:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.66,0:13:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,any player who lost a magic or trap card\Nthis turn also loses 1,000 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.97,0:13:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Rebecca, no! Aw, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.45,0:13:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Her life points are back\Nin the gutter again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.35,0:13:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, short stuff, see what happens\Nwhen you party with the big girls?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.49,0:13:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you'd have better luck\Nplaying a game of Go Fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.69,0:13:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But I think the funniest\Npart of this whole duel is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.61,0:13:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,that you actually thought\NYugi came here to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.05,0:13:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, like he came here to see you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were about to lose this\Nduel, I wouldn't be laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.07,0:13:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where it all ends, Viv.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.33,0:13:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For you, that is my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The first thing I'll do is collect my\N200 points from my good friend Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.23,0:13:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And let's not forget the 500 points\Nyou lose thanks to my fire princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.85,0:13:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still no match for\Nmy dragon lady, Shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess I'll just have to sacrifice\Nmy two monsters to play this card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.11,0:14:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my guardian angel,\NJoan, in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.65,0:14:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And since you already got rid of my gravity\Nvine, guardian angel's able to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.35,0:14:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.26,0:14:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you destroy my dragon lady,\NI'll still have some points left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.09,0:14:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I've done the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.13,0:14:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm activating\Nmy Silent Doom card!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.25,0:14:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card lets me bring one monster\Nback from the graveyard in defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.39,0:14:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And I choose Fire Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.67,0:14:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not her again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.45,0:14:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, I'm afraid so!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.25,0:14:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Guardian Angel,\Nattack her Dragon Lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.43,0:14:54.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing left to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.09,0:14:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's activate Joe's power,\Ngiving my life points a boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.29,0:15:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that in turn activates\Nthe power of my fire princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.39,0:15:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,causing you to lose the\Nrest of your points.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.09,0:15:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Rebecca.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.19,0:15:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.35,0:15:16.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.81,0:15:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We knew you'd pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.13,0:15:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Smoothie! I'm right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.49,0:15:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No one comes between us, Viv.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.97,0:15:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll just see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.31,0:15:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.93,0:15:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The other match just ended, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.13,0:15:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And according to Kaiba's chart, Joey's\Ngonna duel against whoever wins this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.25,0:15:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's that pink-haired freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.79,0:15:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Siegfried Lloyd will\Nnow face Fortune Solis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Weevil, I'm the one who should\Nbe dueling in this match, not you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My insect duck is way better!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.97,0:16:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit stepping on my ear!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Those two?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.21,0:16:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.15,0:16:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Acting like complete numbskulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,What else? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.43,0:16:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice job, Spaz!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the Spaz! You are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.81,0:16:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.05,0:16:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you guys do with\Nthe real fortune, Selene?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, you might say he's tied up right\Nnow, so he asked me and Rex to fill in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.29,0:16:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Rex?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.20,0:16:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He thought we would best fill his shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.79,0:16:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.19,0:16:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, but no one can duel\Nunless they're registered. No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.63,0:16:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the boys duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.13,0:16:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I did wear my favorite suit,\Nand I look too good just to win by forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.83,0:16:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.03,0:16:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Think of your business, Herr Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.19,0:16:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't want to disappoint\Nyour public now, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.25,0:16:55.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So let me duel these two fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who you calling a fool? Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.75,0:17:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,we're not the ones with the pink\Nhair and outdated leisure suit,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,so watch who you're calling a fool,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you're watching, Herr Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.73,0:17:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,because I have a special\Nshow in store just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't trust this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.71,0:17:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, punk! My move!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll start by summoning\Nmy Pinkhopper in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll activate this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.81,0:17:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My aerosol!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.75,0:17:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It exterminates my insect!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.13,0:17:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And now the real fun can begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.13,0:17:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Once my Pinchhopper's in the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.95,0:17:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,its special ability lets me\Nsummon any insect monster I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.85,0:17:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And I choose the mightiest\Nof them all, Insect Queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.07,0:18:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, now my partner's\Ngonna get prehistoric on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.11,0:18:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well put.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.49,0:18:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, I summon Balloon\NLizard in attack mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.03,0:18:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll use this card, Ultra Evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all I have to do is\Nsacrifice my lizard friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.63,0:18:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That allows me to summon any\Ndinosaur card that I want!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.21,0:18:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet Black Tyreno!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see you get\Npast my Jurassic giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And even if you do, you won't stand a\Nchance against my incredible insect!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.61,0:18:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.53,0:18:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you smiling at?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.35,0:18:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be bluffing, Weevil! It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,My conquest has already begun to blossom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.73,0:18:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I shall harvest my victory with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.65,0:18:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ride of the Valkyries!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.69,0:19:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The most dazzling\Ncreatures in Duel Monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.73,0:19:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,And also the most dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.49,0:19:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.79,0:19:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my insect queen and my tyranny?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.05,0:19:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Weevil, tell me that didn't just happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.97,0:19:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't just happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The winner of this bout after\Nonly one turn is Siegfried Lloyd!
